+# Changelog
+
+In-repo release lineage for Snowride (finding `HYG-P3-001`). Append-only: each
+released version gets a section here, the workspace `package.json` versions are
+bumped in lockstep with the tag, and the release commit records its migration
+head. Before this file, releases were tracked only in `evidence/` closeouts,
+`GATE_LEDGER.csv` and git tags (`roundN-metadata-closure`).
+
+Per-axis compatibility versions — canonical score, ghost format, tricks,
+rating, economy, progression, event/course, replay object, social — are a
+separate, authoritative contract in
+[`docs/product/VERSION_ANALYTICS_POLICY.md`](docs/product/VERSION_ANALYTICS_POLICY.md);
+do not conflate them with the package/release version.
+
+Format: [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/).
+Versioning: [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
+
+## [Unreleased]
+
+## [0.1.0] - 2026-09-08
+
+Foundation rebuild baseline. All workspace `package.json` files are `0.1.0`
+(`snowride`, `@snowride/web`, `@snowride/realtime`, `@snowride/game-core`,
+`@snowride/contracts`, `@snowride/config`). The monorepo scaffold and toolchain
+pins land in `c4ec021`; the phase-by-phase history that predates this file is
+recorded in `GATE_LEDGER.csv` and `evidence/closeout/`.
